WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.120
Good morning John. There is a Roast Yourself challenge happening right now.

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:08.340
I've got some lyrics.
We're gonna do it. It's probably a bad idea.

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:09.580
(British voice-over says: "Absolutely brilliant")

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:14.760
Yo. Wassup, Hank Green. Here to roast myself like Ryan Higa said.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.260
Givin' it all I got to give.

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.800
But she's not gonna.

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:45.000
Cause I'm a gangly white dude roasting myself on Youtube.

00:01:45.220 --> 00:01:51.640
I'm maybe a little old to be doing this stuff... Maybe a little less silly in the future? Just chill it out a little bit.

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:56.760
I feel like... I feel like maybe focus on the educational stuff?

00:01:56.880 --> 00:02:01.580
Not the fun, hip rapping challenges. That doesn't seem like a good idea.

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:12.800
Thanks for bearing with me on that one, entire world. Not just the people who watched, everyone. I apologize.

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:18.140
I don't know why I was like "Hey, let's do a song challenge! You don't have enough to do right now."

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:24.760
If you didn't know, Vidcon's coming up. I try not to talk too much about Vidcon because most people can't go. Even though it's a really good time.

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:31.640
But! For the first time ever this year, thanks to a sponsorship from Youtube, we are going to be able to Livestream significant portions of the event.

00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:36.500
So yee, people who can't go, at least know that's a thing. If you wanna check it out, please do!

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:40.080
Thanks to Ryan Higa for injecting some silly into the Youtube community.

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:43.120
We take ourselves too seriously sometimes. No doubt about that.

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:49.440
Also, this is a thing we're doing now. It's a little tiny french llama vinyl toy. And I think it's cute.

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:55.140
We never done toys like this before. It's seven dollars and you can get it at DFTBA.com.

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:59.920
If there's a way for me to apologize for ever rapping, just let me know in the comments.

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:04.760
John, I'll see you on Tuesday. Tuesday! Not Wednesday. Never Wednesday. Tuesday! What the heck.

